    kind: invariant  # 27c3
    title: "A test that sets sys.settrace and does not put back what it found switches coverage off for the rest of its worker on Python 3.11 (CI), and nothing says so"  # 27c3
    status: pending_validation  # 27c3
    priority: 3  # 27c3
    parent:  # 27c3
    tags:  # 27c3
